stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> CREATED
    CREATED --> WAITING_FOR_SLOT: persisted, no slot
    CREATED --> ADMITTED: slot + quotas granted
    WAITING_FOR_SLOT --> ADMITTED: scheduler claims slot
    ADMITTED --> STARTING
    STARTING --> RUNNING
    RUNNING --> PAUSE_REQUESTED
    PAUSE_REQUESTED --> PAUSING
    PAUSING --> PAUSED: checkpoint durable, slot released
    PAUSED --> WAITING_FOR_SLOT: resume requested
    RUNNING --> RETRY_WAIT: retryable failure
    RETRY_WAIT --> RUNNING: backoff elapsed
    RUNNING --> CANCEL_REQUESTED
    WAITING_FOR_SLOT --> CANCELLED
    PAUSED --> CANCELLED
    CANCEL_REQUESTED --> CANCELLING
    CANCELLING --> CANCELLED
    RUNNING --> UNKNOWN_RESULT: lease lost / worker disappeared
    UNKNOWN_RESULT --> RECONCILING
    RECONCILING --> RUNNING: safely resumable
    RECONCILING --> SUCCEEDED: receipt proves completion
    RECONCILING --> FAILED: terminal evidence
    RECONCILING --> MANUAL_RECOVERY: ambiguity remains
    MANUAL_RECOVERY --> RUNNING: approved recovery
    MANUAL_RECOVERY --> FAILED: operator closes
    RUNNING --> SUCCEEDED
    RUNNING --> FAILED
    SUCCEEDED --> [*]
    FAILED --> [*]
    CANCELLED --> [*]
